Backend setup and run:

1) Install dependencies (from workspace root):
npm --prefix Frontend install

2) Configure environment (file already exists):
Frontend/server/.env

Required keys:
PORT=3001
JWT_SECRET=<long-random-secret>
ADMIN_ID=admin
ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=<bcrypt-hash>

3) Generate admin password hash:
npm --prefix Frontend run admin:hash -- yourAdminPassword

4) Start backend only:
npm --prefix Frontend run backend:start

5) Backend health check:
npm --prefix Frontend run backend:health

6) Start full stack (backend + frontend):
npm start

Backend routes:

1) GET /api/health
2) GET /api/auth/check-email?email=<email>
3) POST /api/auth/register
4) POST /api/auth/login
5) POST /api/auth/admin/login
6) GET /api/me (Bearer token required)
7) POST /api/stats/game (Bearer token required)

Important:

1) This project backend is Node.js/Express, not Python.
2) Do not run python app.py for backend in this repo.